---
// Sin props
---
<section class="py-32 px-6 bg-surface relative" id="contacto">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_rgba(111,61,217,0.05)_0%,_transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto glass-panel p-12 md:p-20 rounded-[3rem] text-center">
    <h2 class="font-headline text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-on-surface mb-6">
      ¿Tienes un proyecto en mente?
    </h2>
    <p class="text-on-surface-variant text-xl mb-12">
      Estoy disponible para freelance, colaboraciones y empleo. Hablemos.
    </p>
    <a
      href="mailto:tu@email.com"
      class="btn-primary text-on-primary font-bold px-12 py-5 rounded-full text-xl hover:shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(111,61,217,0.5)] transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-3"
    >
      Enviar mensaje
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined">send</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>